; workflow_walk.eval - EditorTest phase 18, part 2 (tool-refinement Phase 7):
; the four stages as ONE PATH, run inside p7_world (made by workflow_worlds.eval
; in Dirt Tunnels, its keep dungeon naming that style).
;
;   add      [+] opens on the dungeon's style; Create makes a floor in it and
;            lands in the Build stage with the style armed - no Level settings
;            visit, no palette donor
;   build    an empty floor in the style, then room + corridor + stamp
;   populate the dialog's Populate, then the console's at a known density
;   overview "what next" says build, then populate, then check / ready
logecho on
reset
timescale 0
freeze on
editor
; Somewhere other than Build, so landing there is visible - in BOTH groupings,
; since each remembers its own group.
editor palette mode stage
editor palette group populate
editor palette mode kind
editor palette group creatures

echo --- add ---
generate dialog new
generate dialog create
generate dialog off
editor palette
styles

echo --- empty ---
editor palette mode stage
editor palette group populate
editor palette mode kind
generate dialog new
generate dialog empty
editor palette
styles
editor overview level
editor overview follow next level

echo --- build ---
editor shape room 2 2 5 5
editor shape corridor 7 8 4 5
editor shape stamp l_room 11 3 0
editor overview level
editor overview follow next level

echo --- populate ---
generate dialog
generate dialog populate
generate dialog off
generate populate style:dirt_tunnels density:2 seed:3
editor overview level
editor overview follow next level
generate dialog off
savemap
